# Huntsman Search Engine (HSE) — API Key Configuration
# Copy this file to ~/.huntsman.env and fill in your API keys.
# HSE reads from ~/.huntsman.env on startup; keys are never logged or exposed.
# All keys are optional. Omitting a key disables that paid module.

# ============================================================================
# BREACH & STEALER INTELLIGENCE
# ============================================================================

# OathNet Pro — breach + stealer intelligence, highest-confidence data
# Signup: https://oathnet.org
# Docs: https://oathnet.org/docs
# Cost: Multiplier-tier service ($/lookup), session-bundled
# Format: ****** (opaque)
# HUNTSMAN_OATHNET_KEY=your_oathnet_bearer_token_here

# SeekNow (see-know.eu) — 212M+ breach records, stealer logs, OSINT intelligence
# Signup: https://see-know.eu/signup
# Dashboard: https://see-know.eu/account/dashboard
# Official Docs: https://see-know.eu/docs/api
# Cost: Plans from Beginner (100/day) to Enterprise (unlimited daily credits)
# Format: API key (typically 64+ characters, starts with "seek-")
#
# Authentication: Automatically uses X-API-Key header (per official spec)
# Endpoints: 24 endpoints across search, stealer, social, network, domain, gaming, enterprise
# Rate Limits: Managed automatically via rate-limit headers on every response
# Credit System: Most endpoints = 1 credit, stealer logs = 2, enterprise = 5, credits/status = 0
#
# HSE Automatic Features:
#   * Auto-detects daily credit limit from /credits endpoint (free, no budget consumed)
#   * Dynamic per-scan budget scaling (limit / 20, clamped 300-2500)
#   * Intelligent endpoint routing by target type (email, username, phone, domain, ip, name)
#   * Automatic fallback on quota exhaustion (module stops, others continue)
#   * Request caching to avoid duplicate lookups (in-process cache, 1024 entries)
#   * Response archiving to ~/.hse/raw_archive/see-know/ for audit/replay
#   * API key fingerprinting (shows provider:head...tail in results, never full secret)
#
# HUNTSMAN_SEEKNOW_KEY=seek-your-api-key-here

# Intelligence X — breach/dark-web/leaked data search
# Signup: https://intelx.io/
# Docs: https://intelx.io/api
# Cost: Paid plans required
# Format: API key (UUID)
# HUNTSMAN_INTELX_KEY=your_intelx_api_key_here

# DeHashed — breach search v2
# Signup: https://dehashed.com/
# Docs: https://dehashed.com/docs
# Cost: Paid plans required
# Format: API key (opaque)
# Note: v2 API is POST-only; no key-pool validation probe (it would spend a paid credit)
# HUNTSMAN_DEHASHED_KEY=your_dehashed_api_key_here

# HaveIBeenPwned — personal breach search
# Signup: https://haveibeenpwned.com/API/Key
# Docs: https://haveibeenpwned.com/API/v3
# Cost: Paid key required for most endpoints
# Format: API key (hibp-api-key header)
# HUNTSMAN_HIBP_KEY=your_hibp_api_key_here

# BreachDirectory — credential exposure search (RapidAPI)
# Signup: https://rapidapi.com/rohan-patra/api/breachdirectory
# Cost: Paid plans via RapidAPI
# Format: RapidAPI key (X-RapidAPI-Key header)
# HUNTSMAN_BREACHDIR_KEY=your_breachdirectory_rapidapi_key_here

# NiamonX — breach search (PBS v1)
# Signup: https://niamonx.io/
# Cost: Paid plans required
# Format: API key (X-API-Key header)
# HUNTSMAN_NIAMONX_KEY=your_niamonx_api_key_here

# OSINT Cat — breach/leak intelligence
# Signup: https://osintcat.net/
# Cost: Paid plans required
# Format: API key (x-api-key header)
# HUNTSMAN_OSINTCAT_KEY=your_osintcat_api_key_here

# ============================================================================
# INFRASTRUCTURE / IP / DOMAIN INTELLIGENCE
# ============================================================================

# Shodan — IP/domain/cert intelligence
# Signup: https://www.shodan.io/
# Docs: https://developer.shodan.io/api
# Cost: Paid plans required for most endpoints
# Format: API key (key query param)
# HUNTSMAN_SHODAN_KEY=your_shodan_api_key_here

# Censys — certificate + IP/domain data
# Signup: https://censys.io/
# Docs: https://censys.io/api/
# Cost: Paid plans required
# Format: Two-part auth (APP_ID + API_SECRET used together as HTTP Basic Auth)
# HUNTSMAN_CENSYS_ID=your_censys_app_id_here
# HUNTSMAN_CENSYS_SECRET=your_censys_api_secret_here

# SecurityTrails — historical DNS + domain intelligence
# Signup: https://securitytrails.com/
# Docs: https://docs.securitytrails.com/
# Cost: Paid plans required
# Format: API key (APIKEY header)
# HUNTSMAN_SECTRAILS_KEY=your_securitytrails_key_here

# LeakIX — exposure/leak intelligence
# Signup: https://leakix.net/
# Docs: https://leakix.net/help
# Cost: Paid plans required
# Format: API key (api-key header)
# HUNTSMAN_LEAKIX_KEY=your_leakix_api_key_here

# Onyphe — internet-wide cyberdefense telemetry
# Signup: https://www.onyphe.io/
# Docs: https://www.onyphe.io/documentation/api
# Cost: Paid plans required
# Format: API key (bearer token)
# HUNTSMAN_ONYPHE_KEY=your_onyphe_api_key_here

# ZoomEye — internet-wide asset search (IP/domain)
# Signup: https://www.zoomeye.org/
# Docs: https://www.zoomeye.org/doc
# Cost: Paid plans required
# Format: API key (API-KEY header)
# HUNTSMAN_ZOOMEYE_KEY=your_zoomeye_api_key_here

# FOFA — internet asset reconnaissance
# Signup: https://fofa.info/
# Docs: https://fofa.info/api
# Cost: Paid plans required
# Format: API key (key query param)
# HUNTSMAN_FOFA_KEY=your_fofa_api_key_here

# Netlas — internet-wide network asset intelligence
# Signup: https://netlas.io/
# Docs: https://docs.netlas.io/
# Cost: Paid plans required
# Format: API key (X-API-Key header)
# HUNTSMAN_NETLAS_KEY=your_netlas_api_key_here

# BinaryEdge — internet-wide exposure mapping
# Signup: https://www.binaryedge.io/
# Docs: https://docs.binaryedge.io/
# Cost: Paid plans required
# Format: API key (X-Key header)
# HUNTSMAN_BINARYEDGE_KEY=your_binaryedge_api_key_here

# BuiltWith — website technology fingerprinting
# Signup: https://builtwith.com/
# Docs: https://api.builtwith.com/
# Cost: Paid plans required
# Format: API key (KEY query param)
# HUNTSMAN_BUILTWITH_KEY=your_builtwith_api_key_here

# WhoisXML API — WHOIS/DNS/IP intelligence
# Signup: https://www.whoisxmlapi.com/
# Docs: https://www.whoisxmlapi.com/documentation/
# Cost: Paid plans required
# Format: API key (apiKey query param)
# HUNTSMAN_WHOISXML_KEY=your_whoisxml_api_key_here

# C99.nl — domain/IP reconnaissance toolkit
# Signup: https://api.c99.nl/
# Cost: Paid plans required
# Format: API key (key query param)
# HUNTSMAN_C99_KEY=your_c99_api_key_here

# FullHunt — attack surface management
# Signup: https://fullhunt.io/
# Docs: https://api-docs.fullhunt.io/
# Cost: Paid plans required
# Format: API key (X-API-KEY header)
# HUNTSMAN_FULLHUNT_KEY=your_fullhunt_api_key_here

# DomainsDB — domain database search
# Signup: https://domainsdb.info/
# Cost: Paid plans required (key mandatory as of 2025)
# Format: API key (bearer token)
# HUNTSMAN_DOMAINSDB_KEY=your_domainsdb_api_key_here

# ============================================================================
# THREAT INTELLIGENCE
# ============================================================================

# VirusTotal — malware/phishing/infrastructure scanning
# Signup: https://www.virustotal.com/
# Docs: https://developers.virustotal.com/reference
# Cost: Free tier + paid plans
# Format: API key (x-apikey header)
# HUNTSMAN_VIRUSTOTAL_KEY=your_virustotal_api_key_here

# IPQualityScore — IP fraud/proxy/VPN detection
# Signup: https://www.ipqualityscore.com/
# Docs: https://www.ipqualityscore.com/documentation/
# Cost: Free tier + paid plans
# Format: API key (key query param)
# HUNTSMAN_IPQS_KEY=your_ipqs_api_key_here

# GreyNoise — internet-wide noise classification
# Signup: https://www.greynoise.io/
# Docs: https://docs.greynoise.io/
# Cost: Free community tier + paid enterprise
# Format: API key (key header)
# HUNTSMAN_GREYNOISE_KEY=your_greynoise_api_key_here

# URLScan.io — URL/domain sandbox scanning
# Signup: https://urlscan.io/
# Docs: https://urlscan.io/docs/api/
# Cost: Free tier + paid plans
# Format: API key (API-Key header)
# HUNTSMAN_URLSCAN_KEY=your_urlscan_api_key_here

# AbuseIPDB — IP abuse/reputation database
# Signup: https://www.abuseipdb.com/
# Docs: https://docs.abuseipdb.com/
# Cost: Free tier + paid plans
# Format: API key (Key header)
# HUNTSMAN_ABUSEIPDB_KEY=your_abuseipdb_api_key_here

# PulseDive — threat intelligence platform
# Signup: https://pulsedive.com/
# Docs: https://pulsedive.com/api/
# Cost: Free tier + paid plans
# Format: API key (key query param)
# HUNTSMAN_PULSEDIVE_KEY=your_pulsedive_api_key_here

# ThreatFox — IOC sharing (abuse.ch)
# Signup: https://threatfox.abuse.ch/
# Cost: Free with API key
# Format: API key (API-KEY header)
# Note: abuse.ch Auth-Key is shared with URLhaus/MalwareBazaar — set one or both
# HUNTSMAN_THREATFOX_KEY=your_threatfox_api_key_here

# URLhaus — malicious URL database (abuse.ch)
# Signup: https://urlhaus.abuse.ch/
# Cost: Free with API key
# Format: API key (Auth-Key header, same pool as ThreatFox if using unified auth)
# HUNTSMAN_ABUSECH_KEY=your_abusech_api_key_here

# AlienVault OTX — IP/domain reputation + passive DNS (used by ip_reputation)
# Signup: https://otx.alienvault.com/api
# Cost: Free with API key
# Format: API key (X-OTX-API-KEY header). Optional — ip_reputation works keyless,
# but the keyless tier 429s readily; a key (poolable) makes the OTX passes,
# especially passive-DNS enumeration, reliable across a multi-target scan.
# HUNTSMAN_ALIENVAULT_KEY=your_alienvault_otx_api_key_here

# PassiveTotal / RiskIQ — historical passive DNS + infrastructure
# Signup: https://community.riskiq.com/
# Docs: https://api.passivetotal.org/api/docs/
# Cost: Paid plans required
# Format: username:api_key (HTTP Basic Auth pair)
# HUNTSMAN_PASSIVETOTAL_KEY=your_passivetotal_api_key_here

# CriminalIP — cybercrime intelligence / IP reputation
# Signup: https://www.criminalip.io/
# Docs: https://www.criminalip.io/developer/api
# Cost: Paid plans required
# Format: API key (x-api-key header)
# HUNTSMAN_CRIMINALIP_KEY=your_criminalip_api_key_here

